sory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-walkeshwar-mumbai)\n5. Lodha Malabar\n\n[![Lodha Malabar Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/t8d64ojKsI5Q5XDckoKg28UQ0tc6dwPvf0HsTZlI.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Lodha Malabar\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n6.2 Acres\n\nG+31 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nJune 2027\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n**Planning to buy a property in Lodha Malabar walkeshwar, Mumbai? Check out these details below**\n\nLodha Malabar is a new launch luxury residential project in walkeshwar, Mumbai. JP INFRA offers luxury 4BHK and 5BHK flats in Mumbai for sale, featuring lifetime access to a golf club.\n\n**Lodha Malabar Connectivity**  \n Located in walkeshwar, Mumbai. Lodha Malabar is situated in a well-established area. The location is in proximity to:\n\n* Sir H. N. Reliance Foundation Hospital\n* Edubridge International School\n* Heera Panna Shopping Center\n* Eastern Express Hwy, Nagpada\n* University Of Mumbai\n* Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Intl Airport\n\n**Project Details of Lodha Malabar Mumbai**  \n The Lodha Malabar Project, developed by JP INFRA, spans 6.2 acres and features 1 high-rise tower with G+31 floors.\n\n**Carpet Area**  \n Lodha Malabar is an Under Construction project by JP INFRA. in walkeshwar, Mumbai, offering 4BHK and 5BHK flats for sale. A perfect combination of inspiring architecture, high-end specifications, and connectivity with major expressways are added advantages for comfortable living. The carpet areas of these Mumbai flats are\n\n* 4 BHK - 3826-4036 Sq.ft\n* 5 BHK - 6271-6640 Sq.ft\n\n**Amenities**  \n Lodha Malabar Mumbai by JP INFRA offers 10+ lifestyle amenities, such as -\n\n* Gym\n* Club house\n* Kids Play Area\n* Banquet Hall\n\n**Rera & Possession Timeline**  \n JP INFRA New Launch Lodha Malabar Rera Number is P51900034949, and the Rera Possession is in June 2027.\n\n**Why invest in JP INFRA Mumbai property?**\n\n* Well-established Location\n* Upgraded Lifestyle\n* Good Safety & Security\n* Easy Access to Basic Facilities\n\nTo get the reviews of JP INFRA, or to schedule a visit to the Lodha Malabar walkeshwar, Mumbai Project sample flat, call us today!\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nLodha Malabar brochure\n\n## Pricing of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [4 BHK Apartment](#tabs-9)\n* [5 BHK Apartment](#tabs-11)\n\n* [3826 sqft](#tabs-5288)\n* [4036 sqft](#tabs-5289)\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 3826 sqft | Price:\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 4036 sqft | Price:\n\n* [6271 sqft](#tabs-5290)\n* [6640 sqft](#tabs-5291)\n\n![5 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n5 BHK | Carpet Area: 6271 sqft | Price:\n\n![5 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n5 BHK | Carpet Area: 6640 sqft | Price:\n\n## Property Features of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Sports Courts](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.co