Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Malabar mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822916-c87644182ca1d883.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822915-5bd0286e4a60a29d.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 04 Sept, 2026\n\nLodha Malabar\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Lodha Developers Limited](/builder/lodha \"Open Lodha Developers Limited page\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n₹ 65.05 – 112.88 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 56.45 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 28 Jun 2027 Onwards\n\nLodha Malabar offers exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" on Walkeshwar Road, an elite South Mumbai location. The project uniquely borders the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Residents benefit from Club Saint Amand, a private members' club, and a life orchestrated by the luxury hospitality experts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400006\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nLodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n4 BHK3,826 - 4036.79 sq.ft\n\n₹ 65.05 – 68.63 Crore\n\n5 BHK6,271 - 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n₹ 106.61 – 112.88 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n4 BHK₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 65.05 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n4 BHK₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 68.63 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nLodha Malabar is a collection of exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" located in South Mumbai's finest location, on the iconic Walkeshwar Road. The project commands an unmatched address, positioned directly opposite the Governor's estate and touching both the Arabian Sea and the historic Hanging Gardens. This prime positioning places the world literally at the residents' feet. A central feature of the development is Club Saint Amand, a private member's club meticulously conceived around active, social, and leisure lifestyles of its privileged residents. The living experience is orchestrated for seamless comfort and luxury, managed by the discreet and expert touch of the luxury hospitality service, Saint Amand. This service ensures that residents receive world-class attention and a perfectly choreographed life. Lodha Malabar offers Duplex/Pent House/4 & 5 BHK residences. The project is officially registered via the MahaRERA registration number P51900034949.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/fire-safety-system-copy-332581.png)\n\nFire Safety System\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/security-guards.svg)\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/dg-backup-fe3944.png)\n\nDg Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/lounge-area.svg)\n\nLounge Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/deck.svg)\n\nDeck\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cab-pickup-and-drop-off-point-3abc78.png)\n\nCab Pickup And Dropoff Point\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/balcony.svg)\n\nBalcony\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/designer-bathroom-tiles.svg)\n\nDesigner Bathroom Tiles\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/glass-partitions-in-bathrooms.svg)\n\nGlass Partitions In Bathrooms\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmid2hdbv00hasa6x3c2vhj6a/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of2\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most prestigious and luxurious residential areas, known for sea-view living and exclusive neighbourhood standards. It features high-end apartments, iconic mansions, and secure, private surroundings. With limited inventory and elite demand, property values here continually rise over time. The locality blends tranquillity with proximity to major South Mumbai business areas, making it a prized lifestyle and investment destination.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-b56438044a26f42e.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51900034949\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Lodha](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/lodha-logo-jpg-a3a8a1.jpg)](/builder/lodha \"Lodha\")\n\nLodha![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –46 years\n\nLodha Group, operating under Macrotech Developers, is unequivocally one of India's foremost and largest real estate companies, established with a vision for creating world-class residential and commercial landmarks since 1980. Their developer features include a significant emphasis on scale and timely delivery, having successfully completed millions of square feet of development across Mumbai, Pune, and other metropolitan areas. The company's hallmark is its commitment to high-quality construction and an uncompromised customer-centric approach, which has cemented their reputation for building highly desirable properties. Being listed on the BSE and NSE, the group adheres to stringent corporate governance and financial transparency. Lodha specializes in creating large-scale estates that offer holistic living experiences, integrating advanced security, modern infrastructure, and exclusive lifestyle amenities.\n\n80ProjectsCompleted\n\n30OngoingProjects\n\n4In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Lodha Malabar in West Pune\n\nLodha Malabar is developed by Lodha Developers Limited, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nLodha Malabar is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Lodha Malabar at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Lodha Malabar is expected by Jun 2027, as per the RERA filing.\n\nLodha Malabar falls under the STANDALONE housing segment, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Lodha Malabar are P51900034949. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Lodha Malabar is 4390.96 SQM, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces.\n\nKey nearby highlights from Lodha Malabar include Aparna Bhuta, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Birla Open Minds International School Walkeshwar and more within easy reach for daily needs.\n\nLodha Malabar offers 5 BHK, 4 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar offers dedicated parking for residents, ensuring convenience and security for personal vehicles.\n\nLodha Malabar consists of 1 towers with 36 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar is being developed by the developer, a RERA-registered entity ensuring legal and timely construction.\n\nThe carpet area of apartments in Lodha Malabar ranges from 3826 sq.ft sq.ft for 4 BHK to 6640.25 sq.ft sq.ft for 5 BHK, depending on the configuration.\n\nLodha Malabar is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe pricing for units in Lodha Malabar starts from ₹65.05 Cr - ₹112.88 Cr.\n\nLodha Malabar comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nFlats in Lodha Malabar include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.\n\nLodha Malabar offers a wide range of amenities including Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹65.05 Cr per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nLodha Malabar is located at\n\nLodha Malabar offers Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms for a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nThe carpet area for available units ranges from 3826 sq.ft to 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inLodha Malabar?\n\nLodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/maharera-project/lodha-malabar/P51900034949","title":"Lodha Malabar, Walkeshwar Mumbai — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Lodha Malabar](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29033/29033-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51900034949RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Lodha Malabar\n\nby [Lodha Developers](/builder/lodha-developers-limited)\n\n📍 Walkeshwar Mumbai, Mumbai City · 400006\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Lifecycle requires verification**\n\nAsk an advisor to verify the current project and inventory status.\n\nSource stage: New · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\n\\*\\*Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar: The Epitome of Luxury Living in South Mumbai\\*\\*\n\nLodha Malabar, located in the prestigious Walkeshwar area of South Mumbai, redefines opulent living. This iconic residential development combines contemporary architecture with timeless elegance, offering discerning homeowners an address synonymous with luxury and exclusivity.\n\n### \\*\\*Prime Location\\*\\*\n\nSituated at Walkeshwar, one of Mumbai's most sought-after locales, Lodha Malabar boasts stunning views of the Arabian Sea and easy access to key landmarks like Marine Drive, the Hanging Gardens, and the Jain Temples. Its proximity to South Mumbai's business districts and cultural hubs makes it an ideal choice for high-profile professionals and families alike.\n\n### \\*\\*Exquisite Residences\\*\\*\n\nEach residence at Lodha Malabar is meticulously crafted to provide unparalleled comfort and style. Spacious layouts, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows invite natural light while offering breathtaking views of the city skyline and the ocean. Premium fittings, imported marble flooring, and thoughtfully designed interiors reflect a seamless blend of luxury and functionality.\n\n### \\*\\*World-Class Amenities\\*\\*\n\nResidents can indulge in a host of world-class amenities, including:\n\n- A state-of-the-art fitness center\n\n- Infinity-edge swimming pool with panoramic sea views\n\n- Lavish clubhouse for social gatherings\n\n- Landscaped gardens for tranquil evenings\n\n- Concierge services to cater to every need\n\n### \\*\\*Secure and Private\\*\\*\n\nThe development prioritizes safety and exclusivity, offering 24/7 security, video surveillance, and private elevators to ensure complete peace of mind.\n\n### \\*\\*A Legacy Address\\*\\*\n\nOwning a home at Lodha Malabar is not just about living in luxury; it’s about being part of a legacy. Walkeshwar’s rich history and Lodha’s renowned reputation in real estate make this property an investment in both lifestyle and heritage.\n\nExperience the pinnacle of urban sophistication and serene living at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar, where every detail is designed to exceed expectations.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹24,232\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹120,000**\n\n80% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Walkeshwar — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹71,969/sqft\n\nmedian · 19 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹195.2/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹210,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.3%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nJun 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n4 BHK3,607–4,054 ft²₹8.74 Cr–₹9.82 Cr\n\n5 BHK And More7,668–7,923 ft²₹18.58 Cr–₹19.2 Cr\n\n5 BHK Amp Amp7,995–18,230 ft²₹19.37 Cr–₹44.17 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?t